  "title_official": "Authorizing the use of Emancipation Hall in the Capitol Visitor Center for a ceremony to present the Congressional Gold Medal collectively to the women in the United States who joined the workforce during World War II, providing the aircraft, vehicles, weaponry, ammunition, and other material to win the war and who were referred to as \"Rosie the Riveter\", in recognition of their contributions to the United States and the inspiration they have provided to ensuing generations.",
